[{"id":"rust:q30411","language":"rust","contentVersion":"independent-20261028","unitId":"rust:arena01-R-U42","order":411,"level":"intermediate","kind":"choice","title":"enum（列挙型・直和型）：出力を予測する","prompt":"enum（列挙型・直和型）：出力を予測する：何が表示される？ コードの結果として正しいものを選んでください。","conceptIds":["rust:arena01-r-enum","rust:arena01-r-match","rust:arena01-r-option-result"],"prerequisiteConceptIds":["rust:arena01-r-struct","rust:arena01-r-enum","rust:arena01-r-if-match-expr","rust:arena01-r-match"],"introducesConceptIds":[],"setup":{"files":[{"path":"main.rs","content":"enum Shape {\n    Circle(f64),\n    Square(f64),\n}\nfn area(s: &Shape) -> f64 {\n    match s {\n        Shape::Circle(r) => 3.0 * r * r,\n        Shape::Square(a) => a * a,\n    }\n}\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", area(&Shape::Square(2.0)));\n}","editable":false}],"entryPoint":"main","languageVersion":"Rust 1.99.1","edition":"2021","dependencies":[],"note":""},"answer":{"mode":"choice","options":[{"id":"c","text":"12"},{"id":"a","text":"4"},{"id":"d","text":"コンパイルエラー"},{"id":"b","text":"6"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"],"expectedOutput":["4"],"comparison":"exact-lines","orderItems":[],"correctOrderIds":[]},"solution":{"files":[{"path":"main.rs","content":"enum Shape {\n    Circle(f64),\n    Square(f64),\n}\nfn area(s: &Shape) -> f64 {\n    match s {\n        Shape::Circle(r) => 3.0 * r * r,\n        Shape::Square(a) => a * a,\n    }\n}\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", area(&Shape::Square(2.0)));\n}","editable":false}],"explanation":"Shape::Square(2.0) は match の 2 番目の腕に一致し、a に 2.0 が束縛される。2.0 * 2.0 = 4。enum は「どの種類か」と「中身の値」を同時に持てる。Java の enum と違い、種類ごとに違うデータを持てるのが Rust の enum。","reasoningSteps":["Shape::Square(2.0) は match の 2 番目の腕に一致し、a に 2.0 が束縛される。","2.0 * 2.0 = 4。","enum は「どの種類か」と「中身の値」を同時に持てる。","Java の enum と違い、種類ごとに違うデータを持てるのが Rust の enum。"],"wrongReasons":[{"optionId":"b","reason":"円の面積ではない。Square の腕が選ばれる。"},{"optionId":"c","reason":"a * a に 2.0 が入るので 4。"},{"optionId":"d","reason":"両方の腕がそろっているので網羅している。"}],"boundaries":[],